# Original raw source materials (CV docx, raw PDFs, inspiration links, full-res
# headshot) kept on disk for reference but not published or duplicated into git
# -- the site uses the processed copies in assets/ instead.
.source/

# Claude Code tooling config (dev-server launch config, local settings) --
# local machine setup, not site content.
.claude/

# Impeccable design-process working files (product/design docs, sidecar,
# critique snapshots) -- internal working notes, not published with the site.
# Already excluded from the Jekyll build output via _config.yml's `exclude:`;
# this additionally keeps them out of the public repo entirely.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
.impeccable/
